{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07010","headline":"柳陌听早莺 · 陶翰","name":"柳陌听早莺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽来枝上啭，还似谷中声。\n乍使香闺静，偏伤远客情。\n间关难辨处，断续若频惊。\n玉勒留将久，青楼梦不成。\n千门候晓发，万井报春生。\n徒有知音赏，慙非臯鹤鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}